  the fixed state, with technical review: covered entirely by this epic's\n85\t  scope and acceptance criteria.\n86\t\n87\t## Risks / Notes\n88\t\n89\t- Two public-sector customers require the republished conformance statement\n90\t  before their renewal; the renewal dates are externally controlled schedule\n91\t  constraints, not deliverables of this epic — the epic's controllable\n92\t  completion point is the reviewed, republished documentation.\n93\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97b412119e16a9ff","agent_id":"a76977aa3b935d052","session_id":"30454257-140a-49db-af81-5209d36a12cc","uuid":"a27f9774-34b2-4bbb-8d24-91b41f6957ca","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:20:26.540Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-814365e6a66c2de4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
